RoboMME-Plus (robomme_plus), formerly RoboMME-OOD

This distribution contains software derived from RoboMME and
RoboMME-benchmark-OOD, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

RoboMME: https://github.com/RoboMME/robomme_benchmark
RoboMME-benchmark-OOD: https://github.com/hongzefu/RoboMME-benchmark-OOD

The runtime adapts all 16 tasks, simulator utilities and observation/action
wrappers. Modifications include namespaced environment IDs, scene construction,
motion, demonstrations, scoring and execution budgets. Suite extensions are
adapted from the astra-robomme experiments.

UPSTREAM.json preserves source revisions and file hashes from the historical
import snapshot. Its paths and package hashes do not describe the current
release; use the repository's Git revision for current file identities.

Private authoring tools, execution oracles, evaluation rollouts and credentials
are excluded from the public release.
